Implemented the merged-PR state fix in [page.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-055/src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx) and [review-page-helpers.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-055/src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/review-page-helpers.tsx). The review page now derives a single `prIsMerged` state, hides the stale merge-failure banner, hides `Merge & Deploy`, collapses the pre-merge checklist into a terminal merged state, and shows `Merged on GitHub` with timestamp plus `Merged externally` when the local merge status is stale. I also updated timeline normalization so a request with `mergedAt` is treated as merged even if `mergeStatus` still says `merge_failed`.

